{"title":"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/5/2d5095d3f3cde3c5649d6aa1fdbb3040f1174a8b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R=gS-4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"91\" height=\"16\" />. When <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/f/e9f882747cb8cf9fe91d3f208f3df6df9d423d92.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S=8$\" width=\"45\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/1/e01cce0b50216e0027bfa01fb057c4eed4b4ea32.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R=16$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"55\" height=\"13\" />. When <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/d/3adca8931464ec1e62d8f98d625bb82b9e73a28a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S=10$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"54\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/f/eff43e84f8a3bcf7b6965f0a3248bc4d3a9d0cd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is equal to:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/4/604c384094dc137e7bde6405e86d877da0ec5ca2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 11\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 14\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 20\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 21\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{None of these}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"475\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Our first procedure is to find the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/1/311cabda3a9b09f0dde217303ca9d1cd9201dcf6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />. With the given variables' values, we can see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/8/7f81b21303d29b5181694a547d631daf2caaaaf6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8g-4=16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"91\" height=\"16\" /> so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/b/7ab589f46e18f21eb200dded4ade9f93dd22a7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g=\\frac{20}{8}=\\frac{5}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"91\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p><p>With that, we can replace <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/1/311cabda3a9b09f0dde217303ca9d1cd9201dcf6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/d/3adf28c1ab96fc4eddaa890ec574e4cea2caea36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"11\" height=\"37\" />. When <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/d/3adca8931464ec1e62d8f98d625bb82b9e73a28a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S=10$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"54\" height=\"13\" />, we can see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/c/58cd389c8655649f3b4fdd731ccc1aa1bfdd73c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10\\times\\frac{5}{2}-4=\\frac{50}{2}-4=25-4=\\boxed{\\text{(D) 21}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"320\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class